      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "A single day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if any of the provision(s) do not\ncommence before 1 July 2005, they\ncommence on that day.",
      "skos:definition": "A single day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nHowever, if any of the provision(s) do not\ncommence before 1 July 2005, they\ncommence on that day.",
      "cml:asserts": [
