      "values:originalText": "(4) A part-time member may be assigned by the Minister, acting on the\nACMA’s advice, on a full-time basis to an inquiry, investigation or\nhearing. Such an assignment must be in writing.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A part-time member may be assigned by the Minister, acting on the\nACMA’s advice, on a full-time basis to an inquiry, investigation or\nhearing. Such an assignment must be in writing.",
