      "skos:note": "Assignment of part-time member to inquiry or hearing must be in writing"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-20-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20(4) Appointment of members",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A part-time member may be assigned by the Minister, acting on the\nACMA’s advice, on a full-time basis to an inquiry, investigation or\nhearing. Such an assignment must be in writing."
    },
