      },
      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "A member or associate member holds office on the terms and\nconditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act\nthat are determined by the appointer.\n\n\nDecision-making and delegation by ACMA  Part 4\nMeetings  Division 1\nSection 36\nAustralian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025",
      "skos:definition": "A member or associate member holds office on the terms and\nconditions (if any) in relation to matters not covered by this Act\nthat are determined by the appointer.\n\n\nDecision-making and delegation by ACMA  Part 4\nMeetings  Division 1\nSection 36\nAustralian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
