    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-39",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "39 Quorum",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-39"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(1) At a meeting of the ACMA, a quorum is constituted by a majority\nof the members.\n(2) However, if:\n(a) rules made for the purposes of section 29 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\nprevent a member from participating in the deliberations, or\ndecisions, of the ACMA with respect to a particular matter;\nand\n(b) when the member leaves the meeting concerned there is no\nlonger a quorum present;\nthe remaining members at the meeting constitute a quorum for the\npurpose of any deliberation or decision at that meeting with respect\nto that matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) At a meeting of the ACMA, a quorum is constituted by a majority\nof the members.\n(2) However, if:\n(a) rules made for the purposes of section 29 of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013\nprevent a member from participating in the deliberations, or\ndecisions, of the ACMA with respect to a particular matter;\nand\n(b) when the member leaves the meeting concerned there is no\nlonger a quorum present;\nthe remaining members at the meeting constitute a quorum for the\npurpose of any deliberation or decision at that meeting with respect\nto that matter.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-39-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-39-ss-2"
        }
