    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-55",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55 Arrangements with authorities of the Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-55"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The ACMA may make an arrangement with an authority of the\nCommonwealth:\n(a) for the services of officers or employees of the authority to\nbe made available for the purposes of the ACMA; or\n(b) for the services of the ACMA staff to be made available for\nthe purposes of the authority.\n(2) In this section:\nauthority of the Commonwealth means:\n(a) a Commonwealth entity within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or\n(b) a Commonwealth company within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or\n(c) any other body established for a public purpose by or under a\nlaw of the Commonwealth.\n\n\nCorporate planning and reporting by ACMA  Part 6\n\nSection 56\nAustralian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The ACMA may make an arrangement with an authority of the\nCommonwealth:\n(a) for the services of officers or employees of the authority to\nbe made available for the purposes of the ACMA; or\n(b) for the services of the ACMA staff to be made available for\nthe purposes of the authority.\n(2) In this section:\nauthority of the Commonwealth means:\n(a) a Commonwealth entity within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or\n(b) a Commonwealth company within the meaning of the Public\nGovernance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or\n(c) any other body established for a public purpose by or under a\nlaw of the Commonwealth.\n\n\nCorporate planning and reporting by ACMA  Part 6\n\nSection 56\nAustralian Communications and Media Authority Act 2005\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-55-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-55-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b7673cdaa5c5c45b51586a28c172ab292b0218f6d6a8f2f165b8abf831f2388"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-55",
