      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An ACMA official may disclose authorised disclosure information\nto the Minister.\n(2) An ACMA official may disclose to a Minister authorised\ndisclosure information that relates to a matter arising under a\nprovision of an Act that is administered by that Minister.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not limit subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An ACMA official may disclose authorised disclosure information\nto the Minister.\n(2) An ACMA official may disclose to a Minister authorised\ndisclosure information that relates to a matter arising under a\nprovision of an Act that is administered by that Minister.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not limit subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-59a-ss-1"
        },
