    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-59da",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "59DA Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-59da"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "carrier or carriage service provider\n(1) An ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section may disclose authorised disclosure\ninformation if:\n(a) the authorised disclosure information relates to the affairs of\na carrier or carriage service provider; and\n(b) the authorised disclosure information relates to any of the\nfollowing matters:\n(i) customer complaints;\n(ii) customers experiencing financial hardship;\n(iii) customer service;\n(iv) faults and service difficulties;\n(v) rectification of faults and service difficulties;",
      "skos:definition": "carrier or carriage service provider\n(1) An ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section may disclose authorised disclosure\ninformation if:\n(a) the authorised disclosure information relates to the affairs of\na carrier or carriage service provider; and\n(b) the authorised disclosure information relates to any of the\nfollowing matters:\n(i) customer complaints;\n(ii) customers experiencing financial hardship;\n(iii) customer service;\n(iv) faults and service difficulties;\n(v) rectification of faults and service difficulties;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-59da-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005-sec-59da-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b095e9a91a95a4eb5b1b45c0e81e4f9313721efbf3ce03a0c74340f94b461679",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information related to a carrier or carriage service provider's affairs"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-communications-and-media-authority-act-2005#sec-59da",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "59DA Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "carrier or carriage service provider\n(1) An ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section may disclose authorised disclosure\ninformation if:\n(a) the authorised disclosure information relates to the affairs of\na carrier or carriage service provider; and\n(b) the authorised disclosure information relates to any of the\nfollowing matters:\n(i) customer complaints;\n(ii) customers experiencing financial hardship;\n(iii) customer service;\n(iv) faults and service difficulties;\n(v) rectification of faults and service difficulties;"
    },
