      "skos:definition": "(1) The regulations may:\n(a) authorise an ACMA official to disclose authorised disclosure\ninformation in specified circumstances; and\n(b) provide that the Chair may, by writing, impose conditions to\nbe complied with in relation to the disclosure of authorised\ndisclosure information in those circumstances.",
